  "title": "Hexo 单引号渲染异常解决",
  "summary": "「单引号渲染后总自动变成全角，修复一下」",
  "content": "<h2>工具</h2><p><code>hexo-renderer-marked</code> <a href=\"https://github.com/hexojs/hexo-renderer-marked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Github 仓库</a></p><h2>安装</h2><p><code>npm install hexo-renderer-marked --save</code></p><h2>修改配置</h2><p>打开仓库根目录下文件 <code>_config.yml</code>，最末增加：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>marked:</span><br><span>  smartypants: false</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2>部署</h2><p>终端内执行：<code>hexo g -d</code></p><h2>来源</h2><ul><li><a href=\"https://github.com/hexojs/hexo-renderer-marked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">hexo-renderer-marked</a></li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/hexojs/hexo/issues/1981\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Issue #1981</a></li></ul><hr><p>CHANGELOG</p><ul><li>190124 Arlmy 创建、发布</li></ul>",
